  "goodToKnow": "Der Thunfisch (also spelled Tunfisch) is tuna, very popular on pizza and in salads, usually from a can (Thunfisch in der Dose). Der Rote Thunfisch (bluefin tuna) was heavily overfished; quotas since 2007 have helped stocks recover. Labels like MSC mark sustainable fishing. Silent h: say TOON-fish. Plural: die Thunfische."
